OL,3,GNEWSAHomes could be built on former RAF
OL,4,Abase                                   
OL,6,FA former RAF base which was earmarked  
OL,7,Fto be a command centre in the event of 
OL,8,Fa nuclear war could become the site for
OL,9,F167 homes.                             
OL,11,FPlans have been submitted which would  
OL,12,Fturn the derelict site, at Rudloe near 
OL,13,FCorsham in Wiltshire, into a           
OL,14,Fresidential community.                 
OL,16,FTaylor Wimpey, which submitted the     
OL,17,Fplans, said 33 of the homes would be   
OL,18,Faffordable and - if planning permission
OL,19,Fis granted - work would start on the   
OL,20,Fdevelopment in 2027.                   
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
