OL,3,GNEWSAHomes could be built on former RAF
OL,4,Abase                                   
OL,6,FBut several objections have been issued
OL,7,Fin response to the plans, including    
OL,8,Fsome over draining from the Ministry of
OL,9,FDefence (MOD) which said: "We are happy
OL,10,Fto work with developers to identify    
OL,11,Facceptable mitigation measures, as     
OL,12,Fnecessary."                            
